// ---- Entra identity modules (app registrations) ----
// Wired via the identity domain appends main_bicep from azure.context.identity_module_refs,
// plus the trusted-caller backend-audience module appended from
// azure.context.trusted_caller_backend_audience_module_ref (emitted only under a
// managed gateway). Serialized into ONE dependsOn chain across both sources:
// each Entra module creates a Microsoft.Graph/applications + servicePrincipal
// pair, and concurrent creation of multiple app/SP pairs is a documented
// directory eventual-consistency hazard (Azure/bicep#16811). One-at-a-time
// provisioning avoids that class of race as cheap insurance (a handful of
// modules, a few seconds). The dependsOn is genuine (no output reference links
// the modules), so the no-unnecessary-dependson linter does not flag it.
